forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/236145-the-most-badass-awesome-epic-moments-of-the-owod-cannon?p=236437#post236437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With soldier91's post it is basically what HtR is, at least the way I see it anyway. A hunter sees the full scope of the world around him and just how insignificant he is compared to it all. Naturally its truly crushing for him and he considers ending it all. Pretty much every Imbued reaches that moment at least once, provided they live long enough, where they realize just how vast their fight is and how hopeless it is. Some break under the pressure, others become emboldened. <b>In the end he realizes there's still something he can do even if its a little thing.</b> Let's face the Imbued have no chance in hell at eliminating the global conspiracies of other lines, they're too few, too disorganized and just not powerful or influential enough to even challenge them. The best they can do is the small victories.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed. That part was great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-22T21:48:26-07:00","id":237762,"title":"","content":"<i><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Tuesday December 30, 2003</b></span><b>Strange Airship Broadcasts Enigmatic Warning to Paris</b><br /> PARIS, FRANCE-A massive metal Zeppelin appeared above the city this morning, transmitting messages to every radio, television and computer screen in the region from a man calling himself &quot;Czar Vargo, Master of the World.&quot; In what he claimed was his &quot;final message,&quot; Vargo offered emigration to a new world of technological wonders for those who accepted his terms. &quot;You denied my overtures for peace at the beginning of the last century. Now is your last chance. Accept universal brotherhood and join our hidden Utopia. Reject it, and you reap the ruin of your own unreason.&quot;</i><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T05:06:24-07:00","id":238092,"title":"","content":"as a sidenote, I know there were a lot of news in the News Ticker that were never released at that time<br /> <br /> someone got an hold on them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getEleme