mageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-23T16:21:28-07:00","id":238657,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\"><i><b>The Last Game</b></i><br /> In the grand epic that is the Apocalypse, there is one small story that the truly demented demand to hear. The Atlanta based role-playing game publisher, Black Dog Games, went out with a whimper. In the last days, sales of their latest and final game, <i>Fiend: The Pacting</i> shot through the roof. Due in equal parts to the slavering appetites of their oblivious fanbase and the large numbers ordered by conservative religious organizations for burning, their profit margins soared (among RPG companies---ooh, impressive). The sales numbers took another leap when Atlanta police arrested <i>Fiend</i> developer Mickey Li for unlawful sexual congress with an underage goat. Though the end of the world was coming, the developers obliviously ignored all of the signs and kept working until a downtown Atlanta fire paralyzed the already infamous Atlanta traffic. Kept in their offices by the gridlock, they decided to pass the time by gaming. (It's not like they were going to get any work done, right?) Hours became days. The snack machine ran out of food by day three. They were reduced to drinking water out of the backed up toilets by day seven. On day twelve, Andre Gates, <i>Axes and Arcana </i>developer, died when he choked on a twenty-sided die. <i>Lycanthrope</i> developer (and Black Spiral Kinfolk) Evan Stump pulled out an &quot;old family recipe.&quot; Ten days later, Evan had the building to himself. Sadly, he died three days later. One of Jason O'Kelly's numerous piercings slipped past Evan while he was preparing his &quot;Developer Bisque,&quot; and Evan died when it punctured his esophagus.<br /> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T05:03:13-07:00","id":239024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/236145-the-most-badass-awesome-epic-moments-of-the-owod-cannon?p=238568#post238568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>Links to TOJ ticker:</u><br /> <a href=\"http://&#91;URL]https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/alt.games.whitewolf/ziEIovYp70U&#91;/URL]\" target=\"_blank\">The Newsticker items... chronologicaly... (Google Groups)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://&#91;URL]http://rpg-memento.blogspot.com/&#91;/URL]\" target=\"_blank\">Memento mori - news ticker</a><br /> <br /> Looking for anything about unreleased ticker news posts and I can't find anything on it. But I am aware of the material that got unpublished in the Apocalypse book on Nightmaster.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Is the second link for &quot;canon&quot; or fan-made news? I think, the latter given the number of typos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","user":"von Lyttenburgh","date":". 08-24-2014, 08:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-25T01:28:30-07:00","id":240025,"title":"","content":"Dark Kingdom of Jade, where Oda Nobunaga's ghost sliced the Jade Emperor in half got a, &quot;Holy shit!&quot; moment out of me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T10:12:51-07:00","id":248953,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Black Dog </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Game </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Factory</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">- </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">A roleplaying game</span></span> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">company. Under<br /> the aegis of Pentex, the Black Dog Game </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Factory has risen from its former cottage<br /> status to dominate </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">the roleplaying game<br /> market. Black Dog\u2019s games are all </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">based<br /> around the ultra-violent exploits of tragically<br /> hip </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">antiheroes who kill and maim the uncool<br /> mortals in their </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">paths, all the while moaning<br /> about their tortured souls. </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Needless to say,<br /> extended play of Black Dog\u2019s games often </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">leads to violent behavior in the real world.<br /> As if this weren\u2019t </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">enough, Black Dog boxed<br /> sets routinely include various </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">disgusting<br /> Wyrm fetishes and tainted goods in the<br /> guise of </span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cminiatures\u201d and \u201cstory handouts.\u201d</span><br /> <br /> ---------------------------------</span></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T16:50:48-07:00","id":249287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/236145-the-most-badass-awesome-epic-moments-of-the-owod-cannon?p=239024#post239024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Is the second link for &quot;canon&quot; or fan-made news? I think, the latter given the number of typos.</div> </div> </div> </div>apparently they're mixed with the &quot;standard&quot; ones","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T16:15:37-07:00","id":250209,"title":"","content":"It was the total open possibility of Mage the Ascension. The what-ifs were utterly endless - for example: What if a character was conceived and born in the Digital Web, their consciousness first coming to life as a cursor or avatar rather than as a flesh and blood being? And what if this person was awakened? What if the concepts in the Myth of Invariance by Ernest G. McClain were central to the theories of a Son of Ether using the Platonic Harmonies of the Spheres to reality hack through a crystal resonating difference engine? It was the possibilities, that in hubris now lay slain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cIt was clear to me for a long time that the origins of science had their deep roots in a particular myth, that of invariance.&quot; ~ Giorgio de Santillana<br /> Preface to Hamlet's Mill","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2345-whithers","name":"Whithers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2345_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-06T13:20:04-07:00","id":251013,"title":"","content":"That tidbit about Toreador Antedilluvian<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;She had experienced first-hand the viciousness of Gilgamesh&quot; </div> </div> </div>Cannot get out of my head the thought she simply got Gate of Babylon'ed by the King of Heroes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T18:29:29-07:00","id":255718,"title":"","content":"While I know relatively little about the oWOD, the image of the Technocracy blasting a super-vampire to ash with their orbital sun cannon can only be described as &quot;Metal&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-12T19:23:38-07:00","id":255724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/236145-the-most-badass-awesome-epic-moments-of-the-owod-cannon?p=255718#post255718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I know relatively little about the oWOD, the image of the Technocracy blasting a super-vampire to ash with their orbital sun cannon can only be described as &quot;Metal&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually more like 'the image of the Technocracy blasting <i>several</i> super-vampire<i>s</i> to ash with their orbital sun cannon can only be described as &quot;Metal&quot;'. As [Ravnos] had already been fighting several of the oldest, most powerful Kuei-Jin still walking the Earth for three days and nights when the Technocracy finally nuked them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's 